{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A picture book adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>woven from your story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/308a7d3120611919277d2737119ffd36.avif?t=1767853994\" width=949 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u201c<strong><i>In the world of a picture book you wandered into, there was a prince who looked just like you...</i></strong>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A boy who has wandered into the world of a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He will advance the story as a stand-in for the prince, who was originally the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Worldview and Art Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/9ee6cd0d3a878c86c46c79e907ae2655.poster.avif?t=1767853994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/9ee6cd0d3a878c86c46c79e907ae2655.webm?t=1767853994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839510/extras/9ee6cd0d3a878c86c46c79e907ae2655.mp4?t=1767853994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watercolor-style visuals, book-like presentation, and captivating charactersenhance the world of illustrated fairy tales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative and branching elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's choices in action shape relationships with the characters,</p><p 